# Near-vertical manual shots (~85 degrees down), 30 cm from Lobart's roof edge.
# Regression for bow roll and torso yaw during the reload; adapted from recoil2.bench.
# The aim goes straight at the wolf (aimat without mouse), so the side camera does not move the aim.
# A: the bow side, two shots with the reload between; B: the drawing hand's side; C: the same 4x slower.
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
overlay bright off
view full
stats bow 100 talent 0
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 50
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 600
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 60 exact
wait 300
clear 2500
insert Wolf
wait 300
put WOLF 160 0
wait 300
pin WOLF 160 0 -733
wait 300
cam lift off
draw bow
wait 1500
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 400
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 30 exact
wait 300
edgedist 247.5
aimat WOLF body
cam follow 260 60 80
cam look 110
# A: the bow side
press action
wait 2000
rec down_left
wait 400
release action
wait 2200
press action
wait 2000
release action
wait 1800
stop
# B: the drawing hand's side
cam follow 260 60 -80
cam look 110
wait 300
press action
wait 2000
rec down_right
wait 400
release action
wait 2500
stop
# C: slowed down, the bow side
cam follow 260 60 80
cam look 110
wait 300
press action
wait 2000
slowmo 4
rec down_slow
wait 300
release action
wait 2000
stop
slowmo 1
hp WOLF
aimat off
